     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This <a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/google-analytics.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/google-analytics.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389578680000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35ohrQpCzvbPaT72EdPUEL\">RStudio tutorial</a><a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/google-analytics.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/google-analytics.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389578680000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35ohrQpCzvbPaT72EdPUEL\"> </a>shows how to add Google Analytics to your shiny app. There, the necessary tracking code is included via<div><br></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-right-width:1px;border-right-color:white;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-color:white;border-left-width:initial;border-radius:0px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:&quot;Source Code Pro&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">shinyUI</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">fluidPage</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span></span></span>\r\n  \r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">tags</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">$</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">head</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">includeScript</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;google-analytics.js&quot;</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></span>,</span>\r\n</code></pre></div><div><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:&quot;Source Code Pro&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">...</span></code></div><div><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:&quot;Source Code Pro&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br></span></code></div>With a navbarPage layout, wherever I tried to insert the tags$head(includeScript(&quot;google-analytics.js&quot;)) snipped resulted in crashing R Studio when running the app.<div><br></div><div>For instance, this crashed R Studio:</div><div><br></div><div><div>shinyUI(</div><div>  navbarPage(</div><div>    title=&quot;A title&quot;,</div><div>    header=tags$head(includeScript(&quot;google-analytics.js&quot;)),</div></div><div>...</div><div><br></div><div>Any idea how/where to include the tracking file?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Bernhard </div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
