     "<div dir=\"ltr\">PS: For Dashboards, there seems to be a solution <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/shiny-discuss/google$20analytics%7Csort:relevance/shiny-discuss/J2vIB3SHyQI/AbZUSCqxEgAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!searchin/shiny-discuss/google$20analytics%257Csort:relevance/shiny-discuss/J2vIB3SHyQI/AbZUSCqxEgAJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389578680000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0EhJ1VjJGJlxQg0tobZX_b\">here</a>.<br><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ]
